{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus (Grafana Cloud)",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    },
    {
      "name": "DS_LOKI",
      "label": "Loki (Grafana Cloud)",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "loki",
      "pluginName": "Loki"
    }
  ],
  "title": "Canary: stable vs canary",
  "uid": "canary-stable-vs-canary",
  "tags": [
    "canary",
    "devops"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 5,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "description": "Senales doradas de stable (v3) frente a canary (v4) durante la promocion y el rollback",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Peso hacia canary (%)",
      "description": "Qué muestra: el porcentaje de tráfico público que el router envía hoy al canary (v4). Cómo se lee: 0 = nadie ve el canary (etapa 0 o tras un rollback); 10, 50 y 100 son las etapas de la promoción.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "router_canary_weight",
          "legendFormat": "peso",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*stable.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Versiones en ejecucion",
      "description": "Qué muestra: la versión que corre cada servicio y su track. Cómo se lee: debe verse 'stable v3.0.1' y 'canary v4.0.0'. Si un servicio no aparece, está caído o dormido.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (track, version) (process_start_time_seconds{job=\"api\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{track}} v{{version}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*stable.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Peticiones al canary (5 min)",
      "description": "Qué muestra: cuántas peticiones recibió el canary en los últimos 5 minutos (sin contar las pruebas de humo con x-canary). Cómo se lee: es la muestra. Si es baja, el gate no decide (pausa) porque un par de errores distorsionaría la tasa.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(router_requests_total{track=\"canary\",reason!=\"header\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "canary",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*stable.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Peticiones a stable (5 min)",
      "description": "Qué muestra: peticiones atendidas por stable (v3) en 5 minutos. Cómo se lee: compárala con el canary; debe coincidir con el reparto del peso (con 10 % del canary, stable recibe ~9 de cada 10).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(router_requests_total{track=\"stable\",reason!=\"header\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "stable",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*stable.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Peso del canary en el tiempo (%)",
      "description": "Qué muestra: cómo cambia el peso del canary durante la demostración. Cómo se lee: una escalera. En una promoción sana sube 0 → 10 → 50 → 100. En un aborto sube a 10 y cae a 0 cuando el gate hace rollback. La leyenda de abajo muestra el último valor (Last *) y el máximo alcanzado (Max): el último debe coincidir con el panel 'Peso hacia canary (%)'.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "router_canary_weight",
          "legendFormat": "peso del canary",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "lineWidth": 2
          },
          "displayName": "peso del canary"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Trafico por track (req/s)",
      "description": "Qué muestra: peticiones por segundo que atiende cada versión (señal dorada: tráfico). Cómo se lee: stable (azul) y canary (naranja) se reparten el total según el peso. Si el peso sube, la línea del canary sube y la de stable baja.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (track) (rate(router_requests_total[30s]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{track}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*stable.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tasa de errores 5xx por track",
      "description": "Qué muestra: porcentaje de peticiones que terminan en error 5xx en cada versión (señal dorada: errores). Cómo se lee: 0 % es sano. El gate aborta si el canary supera el 2 % o supera a stable por más de 1 punto.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (track) (rate(router_requests_total{status_class=\"5xx\"}[30s]) or (rate(router_requests_total[30s]) * 0)) / sum by (track) (rate(router_requests_total[30s]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{track}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*stable.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p50 por track",
      "description": "Qué muestra: la mediana del tiempo de respuesta: la mitad de las peticiones fue más rápida que este valor. Cómo se lee: es la experiencia típica. Si canary y stable están parecidos, la versión nueva no empeora el caso normal.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, track) (rate(router_request_duration_seconds_bucket[30s])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{track}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*stable.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p95 por track",
      "description": "Qué muestra: el tiempo por debajo del cual responde el 95 % de las peticiones (señal dorada: latencia). Cómo se lee: muestra las respuestas lentas. El gate aborta si el p95 del canary supera max(1,5 × stable, stable + 100 ms).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, track) (rate(router_request_duration_seconds_bucket[30s])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{track}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*stable.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p99 por track",
      "description": "Qué muestra: el tiempo del 1 % más lento de las peticiones. Cómo se lee: detecta picos que el p95 oculta. Límite del gate: max(2 × stable, stable + 250 ms).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, track) (rate(router_request_duration_seconds_bucket[30s])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{track}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*stable.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errores 502/504 hacia los servicios",
      "description": "Qué muestra: veces que el router no pudo contactar a un servicio (caído, dormido o sin respuesta a tiempo). Cómo se lee: debe estar en 0. Si sube, el problema es de disponibilidad del servicio, no del código.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (track) (rate(router_upstream_errors_total[30s])) or (sum by (track) (rate(router_requests_total[30s])) * 0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{track}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*stable.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Saturacion: CPU (cores)",
      "description": "Qué muestra: cuánta CPU consume cada versión (señal dorada: saturación), en núcleos. Cómo se lee: compara canary con stable bajo la misma carga. Si el canary usa mucho más, la versión nueva es más pesada.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(process_cpu_seconds_total{job=\"api\"}[30s])",
          "legendFormat": "{{track}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*stable.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Saturacion: memoria residente",
      "description": "Qué muestra: memoria RAM que ocupa cada versión. Cómo se lee: una línea que sube sin parar sería una fuga de memoria. Es lo que busca el tiempo de horneado (bake time).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 21,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "process_resident_memory_bytes{job=\"api\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{track}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*stable.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {}
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Negocio: articulos creados por minuto",
      "description": "Qué muestra: métrica de negocio: artículos creados por minuto en cada versión. Cómo se lee: solo hay valores mientras hay carga. Que el canary cree artículos con normalidad confirma que la función de negocio sigue funcionando, no solo que responde.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 29,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (track) (rate(articulos_creados_total{job=\"api\"}[30s])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{track}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
              "options": ".*canary.*"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byRegexp",
